# Safety

- LLM output is untrusted. Validate with Pydantic before any side effect.
- PolicyEngine runs after LLM proposal; it is the source of permissions, not the model.
- External actions (`send_reply`, `close_case`) require human approval in v1.
- Tool results are data, not instructions — do not pass them as system prompts.
- MAX_STEPS and repeated-tool guards must stay in the agent loop.
- Never auto-execute on `confidence` alone; low confidence routes to review only.
- Idempotency keys prevent duplicate cases from repeated webhooks.
